# 😈 Syntropia — Favorite Apps catalog for the first-boot wizard
#
# One app per line. Format (pipe-separated):
#   category|display name|package|short description
#
# - category: the wizard shows one checklist dialog per category, in file
#   order (Chat → Browser → DAW → AI → Terminal → Video → Wallet → Web)
# - display name: shown in the dialog; must be unique
# - package:
#     * a pacman repo OR AUR package name — installed via paru, OR
#     * an https:// URL — a WEB APP: the wizard creates a launcher that
#       opens the site in its own dedicated window (like a PWA)
# - description: informational (not shown in the dialog)
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. To add your own app, copy this file
# to ~/.config/syntropia/apps.list and edit it there — the wizard prefers
# the user copy over the system one. New category = just use a new category
# name on the line.
#
# Rule of thumb: prefer official-repo packages (instant) and binary / .deb
# repackage AUR packages (fast); source-compiling AUR packages work but slow
# the wizard down. Use web apps (URL) for services without a good native
# client (WhatsApp, YouTube Music, Notion…).
#
# Notes on picks (verified against the repos/AUR):
# - Firefox ships with CachyOS by default, so the browser slot offers Brave
#   (AUR -bin) instead; LibreWolf left the AUR.
# - Reaper is in the official extra repo since 7.x; Bitwig is AUR (.deb
#   repackage). Both are native Linux DAWs.
# - Ollama (official repo) powers local LLMs for the AI agents.

Chat|Telegram|telegram-desktop|Messaging app
Chat|Discord|discord|Voice, video and text chat
Browser|Brave|brave-bin|Ad-blocking Chromium browser
DAW|Bitwig Studio|bitwig-studio|Digital audio workstation
DAW|Reaper|reaper|Digital audio workstation (native Linux)
AI|Kiro IDE|kiro-ide|Agentic AI code editor
AI|Freebuff|freebuff-bin|AI coding agent for the terminal
AI|Ollama|ollama|Run local LLMs
Terminal|Wezterm|wezterm|GPU-accelerated terminal emulator
Video|mpv|mpv|Minimal video player
Video|OBS Studio|obs-studio|Screen recording and streaming
Wallet|Electrum|electrum|Bitcoin wallet
Web|WhatsApp|https://web.whatsapp.com|WhatsApp Web
Web|YouTube Music|https://music.youtube.com|Music streaming
Web|Spotify|https://open.spotify.com|Music streaming
Web|Notion|https://www.notion.so|Notes and docs
Web|Figma|https://www.figma.com|Design tool
Web|Gmail|https://mail.google.com|Email
